      "source_text": "请说说对这次竞赛的期许！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d4d011727fe6e9ec518eb7c37ad3207312c5d11b3f05d9f5c0841b06d342def",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06a56c61c9981c12c2f7cc9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你精通日本文化。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f50343710f5f655b4ea4e64a14fe0b771543a624fb102f13a71f22383f04b4a2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:965d2f31f66121449c39b690",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你生气起来会很可怕，是真的吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "254a252def8f4888fffd459d35336a2efcfd76e6dd82b8a931b3629e60476680",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ecb5901060a2746813e5c22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近美浦宿舍有发生什么事吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcac6ab85852edaea13e6d80a1467cd0ca5a2480b290ed22198105e7f9c1ceba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:365c0e519528486c657a1367",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近有热衷于什么事情吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a667983e52f68704f5b8d26950927364a2721d11fa64af4010f610aea76ea3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0481c774dc78e4ff1b324938",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "掌握胜利的诀窍是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "750b8d58e40b491d69fdda8ea53a30ec0b363512ff514dfca88582ef27c750fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73215e70f7a2935da6ae56c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很期待你这次也能有帅气的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c74c2a174c55a1192841eaf1366711a89e7f6cc4697118db208c82a66ede4fcb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "22"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f073d99247136f7af6fe1806",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为目白家的赛马娘，会觉得压力很沉重吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a97a50b744409e07df4a49edc7e65508d894b4b79830f4804172cd18c433dcf3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8714347f6c01d9fa7748aec8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞赛时什么事情最重要？",
      "source_fingerprint": "01995ff79ab47d1424696b2b834325bc04124c8490d059765adf949cc05a8e81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d39faf3aa0ed79c0da52e48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你在减重，成果怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f61322225099c587639567ee9287e482acf463d9009efea8024229b0b96aacf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:332e21b60d06edd04aae7080",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "简单来说，强悍的秘诀是！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "222befc26bc0d23b73c44cdd312e91dfabfb6a3c94cc5bd553d4d7168f0ad698",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcdd6853587a57ecb2af61ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若把你那面罩拿掉，会发生什么事？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77a53239e6b7fd693f634ce6b96749959b6416e24c1ae3fa604df225d49b3a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0f9fef08c7098187e0b7867",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有只鸟一直在你头上盘旋呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a43fc1d9d1985bb0eae7cedcdb0a453f6aa4c499b4b7015f84b04ce9cb8b0b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52027cac595e05b3f773f7f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对竞争对手们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a33aa43de0b4c1a16896ff2b811a35f8906cdb32171890bfa12632e3a687cdc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a34a0167b436eff37d48021",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "觉得最辛苦的训练是什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "71bc033852587690846b8662d86cbfac3c299beeeb9fd773b53a23a0123e3eff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "204",
        "227"
      ]
    },
